#. module: bf_kitchen_school_meal
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_kitchen_school_meal/models/school_meal.py:0
msgid "The dish of a meal belongs to the school's company."
msgstr "Le plat d'un repas appartient à la société de l'école."

#. module: bf_kitchen_school_meal
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_kitchen_school_meal.field_bf_school_meal_item__bf_kitchen_dish_id
msgid ""
"The dish of the kitchen this meal is: its recipe gives the cost and the "
"allergens, and the meals served take its ingredients out of the stock."
msgstr "Le plat de la cuisine qu'est ce repas : sa recette donne le coût et les allergènes, et les repas servis sortent ses ingrédients du stock."

#. module: bf_kitchen_school_meal
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_kitchen_school_meal/models/school_meal.py:0
msgid "The kitchen consumption of a meal is set by the kitchen itself."
msgstr "La consommation cuisine d'un repas est posée par la cuisine elle-même."

#. module: bf_kitchen_school_meal
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_kitchen_school_meal/models/school_meal.py:0
msgid ""
"The meals of %(day)s did not leave the kitchen stock: %(reason)s. They will "
"be taken out as soon as it is fixed."
msgstr "Les repas du %(day)s ne sont pas sortis du stock de la cuisine : %(reason)s. Ils sortiront dès que ce sera corrigé."

#. module: bf_kitchen_school_meal
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_kitchen_school_meal.bf_kitchen_school_meal_day_view_form
msgid "The meals of this day have not left the kitchen stock:"
msgstr "Les repas de cette journée ne sont pas sortis du stock de la cuisine :"

#. module: bf_kitchen_school_meal
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_kitchen_school_meal.field_bf_school_meal_item__bf_kitchen_dish_date
msgid ""
"The meals served from this day on leave the stock: those before were not "
"counted with the dish."
msgstr "Les repas servis à partir de ce jour sortent du stock : ceux d'avant n'étaient pas comptés avec le plat."

#. module: bf_kitchen_school_meal
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_kitchen_school_meal.field_bf_school_meal_order__bf_kitchen_picking_id
msgid ""
"The transfer that took this meal's ingredients out of the stock, at the "
"cancellation hour."
msgstr "Le transfert qui a sorti du stock les ingrédients de ce repas, à l'heure limite d'annulation."

#. module: bf_kitchen_school_meal
#: model:ir.model,name:bf_kitchen_school_meal.model_stock_picking
msgid "Transfer"
msgstr "Transfert"

#. module: bf_kitchen_school_meal
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_kitchen_school_meal.field_stock_picking__bf_kitchen_source
msgid "Where a kitchen consumption comes from."
msgstr "D'où vient une consommation cuisine."

#. module: bf_kitchen_school_meal
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_kitchen_school_meal.field_bf_school_meal_day__bf_kitchen_issue
msgid ""
"Why the meals of this day have not left the kitchen stock yet. The hourly "
"pass tries again."
msgstr "Pourquoi les repas de cette journée ne sont pas encore sortis du stock de la cuisine. Le passage horaire réessaie."

